      // would show the layer only for the sweep to hide it again mid-fade
      // (the reported flash). Only sweep-driven triggers (hero-exit,
      // footer, …) may take ownership and drop the veil. (2) Independent
      // of the veil: a 'hero' apply landing well past the hero itself is
      // stale — never re-show mid-page. Threshold scales with the hero's
      // own height rather than a fixed px value: the 'hero' director zone
      // (particle-morph.hbs) and particle-animation-loop.js's
      // _checkHeroReentry() both call 'hero' continuously as you scroll
      // back up through the whole hero (up to ~65% of its height — the
